// hijack on damaged callbacks to increase hop-up points

// hijack already existing (pre-existing) EVO Points system

// either do an engine patch to be able to read hop-up point thresholds for unlocking hop-ups 
// directly from inside a weapon's .txt config, or use a global struct or enum

