// How to have an empty string array? How do we tell that it's empty? If we do array.len() > 0, if we use "NONE" as a member, that condition will always be true, so we'll have to check we don't add mod "NONE" on each iteration through the lockedModArray

// We also need to check when we get to the end of the array <- foreach mod in lockedModArray takes care of this

